<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield 6.527 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield 6.527 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   6.527	 6.50-6.54   6.610 (Oct 16)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 52)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS800 million   6.683	 6.67-6.69   6.813 (Oct 16)</p>
<p>(RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 100)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   6.502	 6.48-6.51   6.540 (Oct 16)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 31)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
